flowchart TD
  A["Raw Text Input\n(SpiderFoot/Logs/Reports)"] --> B["Text Chunker\n(Semantic/Fixed-Size)"]
  B --> C["Rule-Based Preprocessor\n(Configurable Regex & YAML)"]
  C --> D{Confidence Check}
  D -->|High/Definite Match| E[Bypass LLM &\nRoute to Output]
  D -->|Low/Ambiguous| F["LLM Router\n(Prompt + Context Injection)"]
  F --> G["LLM Provider\n(API or Local Ollama)"]
  G --> H["Pydantic JSON Parser\n(Schema Validation)"]
  H --> I[Relevance Scoring &\nConfidence Labeling]
  I --> J["Result Cache\n(SQLite/Redis)"]
  J --> K[Cleaned Output JSON\n& Downstream Workflow]
  
  L[Pipeline Config YAML] -.-> B
  L -.-> C
  L -.-> F
  L -.-> I
  
  M[Async Task Queue &\nRate Limiter] -.-> F
  N[Circuit Breaker &\nRule Fallback] -.-> G
  O[Evaluation &\nMetrics Tracker] -.-> I
  O --> P[Human-in-the-Loop\nReview & Feedback]
  P -.-> L